    "updated_at": "2021-04-22T14:52:05Z",
    "body": "> So my wish is if possible, Starship can check if any of the `.ts` files is plain text before deciding to show Node/Deno module (although it's unlikely you have a video stream named `mod.ts`, but who knows).\r\n\r\nFWIW, we could check file magic to ensure it is not a video stream but I don't think it's worth time doing. It is simply a too rare event to be handled gracefully.",
